    <string name="direlay_permissions_explanation">CarPlay offers Siri and calls only when microphone permission is allowed. With Head unit selected, microphone audio comes from the head unit. Notifications show the running session. Wireless CarPlay uses Bluetooth and nearby Wi-Fi devices; older Android versions require precise location for Wi-Fi discovery. Android 17 also requires local-network access for USB and wireless. USB requires Android VPN consent to route the iPhone network. Only permissions needed by the selected mode and existing location-reporting setting are requested. If a permission was permanently denied, use Open Android app permissions to allow it.</string>
